 battle with  the herald I kind of expected more and  it so happened there was more intended  in the event a leaked work in progress  video shows the real intended ending of  that event everything is as you've seen  it until the herald merges with the tree  then a wide shot of the last reality's  mothership is seen racing towards the  zero point which then lifts that orb  into the ship but the zero point has  other ideas and straight up destroys  that vessel this would have tied into  the story a little better but I guess  epic have other ideas about what they  want from the last reality the only link  to them we have in the game right now is  bikes who became their Warrior last  season so I guess we just wait and see  now  [Music]  a place I demand you visit and look  around  ipala in Slappy the ink squid is its  spiritual animal and inside it's like a  history lesson of fortnite there's a  llama statue from the old Coliseum a  skull from the old desert biome and  skateboard decks from over the years but  it's the sheer volume of tattoo art  around this place from Midas to meowzels  to peely to fish sticks and look an  entire mural wall dedicated to the Chaos  Agent octo Inc is amazing somewhere in  here is a clue to the future but I can't  find it oh and while in Slappy you'll  notice slap juice is the big star on the  island that's the consumable drink  everyone wants but look hard enough and  you'll see that the slope Juice company  is still here but it's desperately going  out of business I'm so down for a  storyline to bring that brand back come  on Epic save slurp juice an unnamed POI  that must be important to the chapter  can be found here a circular floor which  would perfectly fit a zero point inside  it covered firmly the glyphs on the  ground look to be planetary alignment so  let's steel charts and there is a ritual  site close by as it's day one of the  chapter if you have any chapter 4  theories please throw them in the  comments let's see who thinks like the  mustard we call Donald and can predict  the future  something I wanted to look into was the  new Midas boss or rather the Ageless  firstly does this mean we are in the  past or the future because I really  don't know but more importantly I felt  like I'd seen that style of armor before  and those statues too so I wrecked my  brain and remembered a game epic made  that cannot be played anymore Infinity  Blade it was an early mobile phone game  rather basic but it had cool law and it  was quite addicting in that story it was  medieval based yet some people had  technology from the future and some  could not be killed they were called the  deathless these Knights constantly seek  the Infinity Blade yep the very same  thing we wielded back in chapter one and  also in that story the creator of the  sword was locked away in a vault very  much like this one here here's the thing  that really sells it to me as a  crossover to the world of Infinity Blade  remember the rooms found on Kevin the  cube and the last reality they were  first seen in the Infinity Blade Games  so if this was a prequel it would  actually link into both of their laws  this could be recycled ideas and reused  assets but how cool would it be to link  both those games together  [Music]  on the island when in this location  you'll hear the song of the Crustaceans  and should you look on top of the crane  nearby here they are the wobbly blobs  have survived another chapter keep your  ears open they're actually in more  places than you expect especially on  shorelines even in the snow it's been  almost two years since they lasted  anything worth noting yet I still waste  my time finding them rocket League's  octane car did not make it to chapter  four but a new rocket League poster can  be found in The Farmhouse someone who  lives here really loves rocket League a  poster for each season a very strange  sight can be found in multiple locations  are these frog statues one of them is  actually made out of ice I'm clueless  what this represents but I do have a  far-fetched theory geralt of Rivia is  coming to the game and once in a DLC  called Heart of Stone he fought the Frog  Prince I told you it was a stretch frogs  and finally during the live event it was  revealed that crackshot's cabin was  indeed saved and it it already had a  Christmas tree ready for that update in  a few weeks but I can't find it on the  map is it yet to arrive or am I not  looking hard enough I'm Adam thanks for  your time I'll be in my Twitter DMS to  thank people who used my code this week  it really helps stay awesome I'll see  you next time  [Music]
 

